            "category": "description",
            "text": "Image::Epeg versions through 0.15 for Perl embeds an unsupported version of the Epeg library. Image::Epeg includes Epeg 0.9.0 that was last updated in 2004. Epeg is a fast JPEG thumbnail library that was once part of the Enlightenment Project.",
            "title": "Vulnerability Description"
         }
